Parent Task: Differentiate quotation and invoice numbering in Global Quote & PI Generator and ensure approvals use the right number
Reply: Updated the numbering for quotations; invoices still pending.
Output: {"status": "UPDATE", "updated_text": "Differentiate quotation and invoice numbering in Global Quote & PI Generator and ensure approvals use the right number", "subtask_updates": []}

